      "question": "If P = 99, then find the value of P(P² + 3P + 3).",
      "options": {
        "A": "999999",
        "B": "99999",
        "C": "1000000",
        "D": "999000"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Expression is P³ + 3P² + 3P. Add and subtract 1: (P+1)³ - 1. (100)³ - 1 = 1000000 - 1 = 999999.",
      "hash": "4400a508ed093d55",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि P = 99 है, तो P(P² + 3P + 3) का मान क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "999999",
            "B": "99999",
            "C": "1000000",
            "D": "999000"
          },
          "explanation": "व्यंजक P³ + 3P² + 3P है। इसमें 1 जोड़ने और घटाने पर: (P+1)³ - 1। (100)³ - 1 = 1000000 - 1 = 999999।"
        }
      }
    },
